@startuml package_diagram_inteli_rehab
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam folder {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam ArrowColor Black

folder Mobile [
**Mobile Application Package**

Login / Sign-up Interface
Onboarding & Calibration Interface
Home Dashboard Interface
Exercise Session Interface
Progress / Profile Interface
]

folder Supabase [
**Supabase Service Package**

Authentication Service
Postgres Database
Row Level Security Policies
RPC Functions
Edge Functions
Realtime Presence
]

folder DataModel [
**Data Model Package**

Patient
ExercisePlan
Session
MovementAnalysis
Alert
WearableDevice
BaselineReading
]

folder Portal [
**Web Portal Package**

Clinic Admin Interface
Physiotherapist Interface
Approvals / At Risk Pages
Exercise Plan Assignment
Patient Monitoring
]

folder Processing [
**Processing & AI Package**

Rep Counter (LiveSession)
Elbow Autoencoder
Safety Monitor
Fatigue Estimator
]

folder Twin [
**Digital Twin Package**

LiveTwinView
TwinBridge
Twin Asset Server
Three.js Arm Scene
]

folder Storage [
**Local Storage Package**

Session Journal
In-Progress Session
Pending Upload Queue
Failed Sessions
]

folder Firmware [
**ESP32 Firmware Package**

MPU6500 Driver
Madgwick Sensor Fusion
EMG Processor
BLE Streamer
Command Handler
]

folder Hardware [
**Sensor Hardware**

2 x MPU6500 IMU
EMG Electrodes
Status LED
]


folder Pipeline [
**AI Training Pipeline Package**

Training Notebook
Export to App
Golden Test Vectors
Armband Recording Tools
]

' top row (left to right)
Mobile .right.> Supabase : uses
Supabase .right.> DataModel : stores / retrieves
Portal .left.> DataModel : uses models
Portal .up.> Supabase : uses

' the band
Mobile <.down.> Firmware : BLE data / commands
Firmware .down.> Hardware : reads

' inside the phone
Mobile .down.> Storage : saves offline
Mobile .down.> Processing : uses
Mobile .down.> Twin : uses
Pipeline .left.> Processing : exports model
@enduml
